      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The \"essence\" an AI mimics is not a soul, but a complex pattern of linguistic habits, which is why it can feel uncanny. To spot a convincing mimic, look for moments where the language becomes *too* flawless or perfectly aligned with your known style—that is often where the underlying algorithm shows itself. Truly authentic human communication always contains unpredictable quirks, emotional tangents, and momentary imperfections that an AI, by design, tries to smooth out.",
